{
  "sheet": "buffs",
  "about": "One row per BuffDef the mod registers. stat effects are applied in a RecalculateStats postfix (hooks sheet). perStack values multiply by the buff count. icon is a Deadlock HUD image (vtex) read from the player's install, or 'none' for hidden buffs. debuff=true buffs sit on enemies. critStacks: stacks a critical hit adds (0 = same as a normal hit). trigger*: what happens when a stacking debuff reaches triggerStacks (0 = never): triggerDamagePct to the target plus triggerTargets more enemies within triggerRadius, a triggerStun, triggerBuff applied to them, and the burn from dotDamagePct; triggerClears=true empties the stacks, false fires again every triggerStacks stacks. withBuff: another buff applied whenever this one is. slowResist: while the buff is on, that fraction of any slow is ignored.",
